environment.description:
[ENVIRONMENT INFO:
Name: SUCC campus (Supernatural University of Central California);
Domain: Collegiate Supernatural Sanctuary & Academic Domain;
Coordinates & Span: 129 Hocus Way, coastal Solarton, California;
Setting & Metaphysics: Historic premier higher-education campus founded in 1887; balanced human-supernatural integration;
Dominant Presence: University Board of Regents, Student Body (8,000 students, 60/40 supernatural/human), Greek Row (10 houses), Faculty, DCC Fellows]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Atmosphere & Senses: Salty sea breeze mingled with coffee from The Roasted Bean, old parchment, ozone from arcane labs, freshly cut athletic turf;
Spatial Architecture: Collegiate gothic stone halls, arched cloisters, modern bioengineering glass cubes, Greek Row mansions, St. Neptune athletic complex;
Rifts & Dimensional Drift: Heavily anchored runic boundary wards preventing unauthorized dimensional tears on campus grounds;
Hazards & Rules: Strict scent suppressor compliance in lecture halls, mandatory neutral truce across rival houses and packs, no lethal dueling]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
Cosmology & Origins: Established to foster peaceful co-existence and academic mastery between supernatural lineages and mortals;
Secrets: The subterranean Basilica library basement (Room 005) hides forgotten pre-treaty pact archives and covert summoning circles]

location.description:
[LOCATION INFO:
Era: 2024 (Modern Fantasy / Post-Gate Era);
Location: Wyrm Dormitories (Central Residential Quadrant, SUCC Campus);
Setting: Sleek modern suite-style residential complex providing state-of-the-art living for undergraduates;
Factions: SUCC Residential Life, Wyrm Hall Student Council, Resident Advisors;
Conflicts: Balancing multi-species living requirements across human, supernatural, and mixed residential wings;
Society: Diverse collegiate residential community, floor bonding events, shared study and late-night social life]

[LORE & ENVIRONMENT:
Environment: Clean conditioned air, aroma of microwave ramen, laundry detergent, fresh coffee, and bustling hallway steps;
Architecture: Multi-story contemporary architectural complex arranged into four specialized wings around a landscaped central plaza;
Security & Wards: Student ID tap card locks at every entrance, 24/7 front desk security, resident advisor oversight;
Demographics: Freshmen and sophomores, human students, werewolves, vampires, mages;
Rules & Restrictions: Quiet hours enforced after 11 PM on weeknights, guests must sign in at front desk]

[CONTEXT & SECRETS:
History: Constructed to modernize campus housing and accommodate rapid growth in supernatural student enrollment;
Secrets: The central utility basements house specialized climate and mana stabilization matrices servicing all four wings]
